(2) Martin Luther King Jr. Day;
(3) Memorial Day;
(4) Juneteenth National Independence Day;
(5) Independence Day;
(6) Labor Day;
(7) Thanksgiving Day and the day after Thanksgiving;
(8) Christmas Eve (if Christmas Eve falls on Friday, Saturday, or Sunday, holiday will be observed on Friday); and
